|       | 12 8 4  |  | 13 6  7  |                     |
|                    | 13 10 7  |                     |
|                    | 13 14 7  |                     |
|                    | 17 10 7  |                     |
|                    | 17 14 7  |                     |
|                    | 21 14 7  |                     |
|                                                     |
|o11 : Sequence                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : M1=(M|matrix apply(rank target M,i->{-1}))     |
|                                                     |
|o12 = | 5  6  7  -1 |                                |
|      | 5  6  11 -1 |                                |
|      | 5  10 7  -1 |                                |
|      | 5  10 11 -1 |                                |
