|o15 = ideal ()                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|                ZZ                                                           |
|o15 : Ideal of ----[a      , a      , a      , a      , a      , a      ,    |
|               1009  {1, 0}   {0, 0}   {1, 1}   {1, 2}   {0, 1}   {1, 3}     |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|a      , a      , a      , a      , a      , a      , a      , a      , a    |
| {1, 4}   {0, 2}   {0, 3}   {1, 5}   {0, 4}   {1, 6}   {1, 7}   {0, 5}   {1, |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  , a      ]                                                                 |
|8}   {0, 6}                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i16 : family=runfolding%sub(J,SA);                                           |
