Thus this is a flat family!

+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i18 : fiber=ideal sub(family,vars S|random(S^1,S^(numgens A)));             |
|                                                                            |
|o18 : Ideal of S                                                            |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i19 : singFiber=radical ideal gens gb (fiber+minors(codim I,jacobian fiber))|
