fractionalIdeal -- turn a fractional ideal into a proper ideal
**************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        I = fractionalIdeal(sgrp,mons)
        L = fractionalIdeal(sgrp,mons)
  * Inputs:
      * sgrp, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of ZZ, representing a
        semigroup
      * mons, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of ZZ representing the degrees
        of generators of a fractional ideal
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Ideal
  * Outputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, ideal in semigroupRing sgrp

Description
===========

sgrp is a list of ZZ_{>0}, interpreted as generators of a semigroup; mons is a
list of ZZ interpreted as generating a module in the quotient field of sgrp
with the option "Ideal" => false we get a list of integers belonging to the
semigroup, otherwise a proper ideal of the semigroup ring. of the ring
semigroupRing sgrp. In both cases, the program chooses the generators of least
possible degree.

This is perhaps most useful when regarding a blowup or iterated blowup as a
module over the original ring. For example, the sequence of blowups of the
semigroupRing {5,9} is given by semigroupRing{4,5}, semigroupRing{1}:

+-------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : sgrp = {5,9}                                |
|                                                 |
|o1 = {5, 9}                                      |
|                                                 |
|o1 : List                                        |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : sgrp1 = {4,5}                               |
|                                                 |
|o2 = {4, 5}                                      |
|                                                 |
|o2 : List                                        |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : sgrp2 = {1}                                 |
|                                                 |
|o3 = {1}                                         |
|                                                 |
|o3 : List                                        |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : fractionalIdeal(sgrp, sgrp1, "Ideal"=>false)|
|                                                 |
|o4 = {9, 10, 14, 15, 18, 19}                     |
|                                                 |
|o4 : List                                        |
+-------------------------------------------------+
