|                                            |
|o5 = {4, 45, 26, 19}                        |
|                                            |
|o5 : List                                   |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i6 : #gaps L1, socle L1                     |
|                                            |
|o6 = (21, {45})                             |
|                                            |
|o6 : Sequence                               |
+--------------------------------------------+
