|                                            |
|      ZZ                                    |
|     ---[x ..x ]                            |
|     101  2   3                             |
|o7 = -----------                            |
|         2   2                              |
|       (x , x )                             |
|         2   3                              |
|                                            |
|o7 : QuotientRing                           |
+--------------------------------------------+
