LabBookProtocol -- Weierstrass Semigroups in Low genus
******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        s = LabBookProtocol g
  * Inputs:
      * g, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, genus
  * Outputs:
