Since the number of cases gets rather large, we break up the list of all
semigroups into sublists of semigroups of given multiplicity and call the
function nonWeierstrassSemigroups:

+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : m=5,g=8                                                |
|                                                             |
|o10 = (5, 8)                                                 |
|                                                             |
|o10 : Sequence                                               |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : elapsedTime nonWeierstrassSemigroups(m,g,Verbose=>true)|
|(13, 1)                                                      |
|{5, 8, 11, 12}                                               |
|unfolding                                                    |
| -- .229694s elapsed                                         |
|flatteningRelations                                          |
| -- .145032s elapsed                                         |
|next gb                                                      |
| -- .000981119s elapsed                                      |
|true                                                         |
| -- .905498s elapsed                                         |
