********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        LL=nonWeierstrassSemgroups(m,g)
        LL=nonWeierstrassSemgroups(m,g,LLdifficult)
  * Inputs:
      * m, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the multiplicity of a semigroup
      * g, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the genus of a semigroup
